"\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nous avons le plaisir de vous informer que votre candidature pour rejoindre l'équipe\n"
"        enseignante <strong>Campus+</strong> a été acceptée, et nous souhaitons vous inviter\n"
"        à un premier entretien.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;\">\n"
"        <tr>\n"
"            <td style=\"padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE4F0;background:#F5F7FC;font-weight:600;\">\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.campus_interview1_id.display_name\">dim. 12 oct. · 09:00</t>\n"
"            </td>\n"
"        </tr>\n"
"    </table>\n"
"\n"
"    <p style=\"color:#6B7FA8;font-size:13px;\">\n"
"        Si cet horaire ne vous convient pas, répondez à ce courriel et nous en trouverons un autre —\n"
"        le rendez-vous peut être déplacé.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Cordialement,<br/>L'équipe Campus+</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: campus_teacher_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:campus_teacher_management.mail_template_campus_selected
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family:Figtree,'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A2340;line-height:1.7;\">\n"
"    <p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.campus_name_lat or object.partner_name or ''\">Teacher</t>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        We are pleased to inform you that your application to join the\n"
"        <strong>Campus+</strong> teaching team has been accepted.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>The next step is a short meeting. Please reply to this email with the time that suits you best:</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;\">\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"object.env['campus.interview.slot']._free_slots(1, limit=12)\" t-as=\"slot\">\n"
"            <tr>\n"
"                <td style=\"padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE4F0;background:#F5F7FC;\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"slot.display_name\">Sun 12 Oct · 09:00</t>\n"
"                </td>\n"
"            </tr>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </table>\n"
"\n"
"    <p style=\"color:#6B7FA8;font-size:13px;\">\n"
"        Times are shown in local time. If none of these work for you, tell us and we will\n"
"        propose others.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Kind regards,<br/>The Campus+ team</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family:Figtree,'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A2340;line-height:1.7;\">\n"
"    <p>Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.campus_name_lat or object.partner_name or ''\">Enseignant</t>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Nous avons le plaisir de vous informer que votre candidature pour rejoindre l'équipe\n"
"        enseignante <strong>Campus+</strong> a été acceptée.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>La prochaine étape est un court rendez-vous. Merci de répondre à ce courriel en indiquant l'horaire qui vous convient le mieux :</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;\">\n"
"        <t t-foreach=\"object.env['campus.interview.slot']._free_slots(1, limit=12)\" t-as=\"slot\">\n"
"            <tr>\n"
"                <td style=\"padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE4F0;background:#F5F7FC;\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"slot.display_name\">dim. 12 oct. · 09:00</t>\n"
"                </td>\n"
"            </tr>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </table>\n"
"\n"
"    <p style=\"color:#6B7FA8;font-size:13px;\">\n"
"        Les horaires sont indiqués en heure locale. Si aucun ne vous convient, dites-le-nous et nous\n"
"        vous en proposerons d'autres.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Cordialement,<br/>L'équipe Campus+</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: campus_teacher_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:campus_teacher_management.mail_template_campus_documents
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family:Figtree,'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A2340;line-height:1.7;\">\n"
"    <p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.campus_name_lat or object.partner_name or ''\">Teacher</t>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Thank you for meeting with us. Attached you will find:</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>your <strong>Course Breakdown</strong> — the subjects proposed for you</li>\n"
"        <li>your <strong>contract</strong></li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.campus_subject_ids.filtered('is_accepted')\">\n"
"        <p>Subjects proposed:</p>\n"
"        <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;\">\n"
"            <t t-foreach=\"object.campus_subject_ids.filtered('is_accepted')\" t-as=\"line\">\n"
"                <tr>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE4F0;\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"line.display_subject\">Subject</t>\n"
"                    </td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </table>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Please review both documents and <strong>reply to this email</strong> to confirm that\n"
"        you accept them.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Kind regards,<br/>The Campus+ team</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family:Figtree,'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A2340;line-height:1.7;\">\n"
"    <p>Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.campus_name_lat or object.partner_name or ''\">Enseignant</t>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Merci de nous avoir rencontrés. Vous trouverez ci-joint :</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>votre <strong>découpage du cours</strong> — les matières qui vous sont proposées</li>\n"
"        <li>votre <strong>contrat</strong></li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"\n"
"    <t t-if=\"object.campus_subject_ids.filtered('is_accepted')\">\n"
"        <p>Matières proposées :</p>\n"
"        <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;\">\n"
"            <t t-foreach=\"object.campus_subject_ids.filtered('is_accepted')\" t-as=\"line\">\n"
"                <tr>\n"
"                    <td style=\"padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE4F0;\">\n"
"                        <t t-out=\"line.display_subject\">Matière</t>\n"
"                    </td>\n"
"                </tr>\n"
"            </t>\n"
"        </table>\n"
"    </t>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        Merci d'examiner les deux documents et de <strong>répondre à ce courriel</strong> pour confirmer\n"
"        que vous les acceptez.\n"
"    </p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Cordialement,<br/>L'équipe Campus+</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#. module: campus_teacher_management
#: model:mail.template,body_html:campus_teacher_management.mail_template_campus_interview2_invite
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family:Figtree,'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A2340;line-height:1.7;\">\n"
"    <p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.campus_name_lat or object.partner_name or ''\">Teacher</t>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Thank you for meeting with us. Your second interview is scheduled for:</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;\">\n"
"        <tr>\n"
"            <td style=\"padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE4F0;background:#F5F7FC;font-weight:600;\">\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.campus_interview2_id.display_name\">Sun 19 Oct · 09:00</t>\n"
"            </td>\n"
"        </tr>\n"
"    </table>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Attached you will find:</p>\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>the <strong>Course Breakdown</strong> template (Excel) — please complete it</li>\n"
"        <li>your <strong>Contract</strong> (PDF) — please sign it</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Before the interview, please:</p>\n"
"    <ol>\n"
"        <li>Confirm this appointment by replying to this email</li>\n"
"        <li>Complete the Course Breakdown</li>\n"
"        <li>Send us the completed Course Breakdown</li>\n"
"        <li>Sign the Contract</li>\n"
"        <li>Send us the signed Contract</li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Kind regards,<br/>The Campus+ team</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family:Figtree,'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#1A2340;line-height:1.7;\">\n"
"    <p>Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.campus_name_lat or object.partner_name or ''\">Enseignant</t>,</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Merci de nous avoir rencontrés. Votre second entretien est prévu le :</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:16px 0;\">\n"
"        <tr>\n"
"            <td style=\"padding:6px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE4F0;background:#F5F7FC;font-weight:600;\">\n"
"                <t t-out=\"object.campus_interview2_id.display_name\">dim. 19 oct. · 09:00</t>\n"
"            </td>\n"
"        </tr>\n"
"    </table>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Vous trouverez ci-joint :</p>\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"        <li>le modèle de <strong>découpage du cours</strong> (Excel) — merci de le compléter</li>\n"
"        <li>votre <strong>contrat</strong> (PDF) — merci de le signer</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Avant l'entretien, merci de :</p>\n"
"    <ol>\n"
"        <li>Confirmer ce rendez-vous en répondant à ce courriel</li>\n"
"        <li>Compléter le découpage du cours</li>\n"
"        <li>Nous envoyer le découpage du cours complété</li>\n"
"        <li>Signer le contrat</li>\n"
"        <li>Nous envoyer le contrat signé</li>\n"
"    </ol>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Cordialement,<br/>L'équipe Campus+</p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

